<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · song</p><h1 class="enc-title">Oh Uganda, Land of Beauty</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1962">1962</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">&quot;Oh Uganda, Land of Beauty&quot; is the national anthem of Uganda. From 1894 until the height of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/decolonisation">decolonisation</a> in the 1960s, Uganda was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/protectorate">protectorate</a> of the United Kingdom within its colonial empire. In the run-up to independence a subcommittee was formed to choose an anthem for the coming state.</p></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>&quot;<b>Oh Uganda, Land of Beauty</b>&quot; is the national anthem of Uganda.</blockquote><a href="/songs/oh-uganda-land-of-beauty">Oh Uganda, Land of Beauty</a></li></ul></section>
